    <string name="about_disclaimer_title">Wellness Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_text">BlinkWell is a general wellness tool that estimates your blink rate using your device\'s camera. It is not a medical device and does not diagnose, treat, or prevent any condition. Lighting, glasses, and camera angle can affect accuracy. If you have concerns about dry eyes, eye strain, or vision changes, please consult an eye care professional.</string>

